    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We enter a world that seems familiar but not quite. As you dive into the your memories you slowly regain bits and pieces of the things you once held valuably. People you feel you have seen but don't recognize gift you with visions that assists you throughout your journey. Slowly you lose your mental integrity; however, you fight through to reclaim the things that was once yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992320/extras/4649f4a63f8741c3916d1ca65a6387f4.avif?t=1734645043\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kioku is a rhythmy souls-rouge like indie game. Crafted with inspiration and love drawn from video games we loved playing growing up. For gamers who enjoy skill based movement and rogue like progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992320/extras/10612a1688b6a88068ddcf323b7e5b38.avif?t=1734645043\" data-has-big width=800 height=1130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
